model bounded_counter_unfair "The same counter with no fairness assumption"
description "Identical to bounded_counter but with no fairness. In TLA+ semantics a behaviour may stutter forever, so 'eventually count = 3' is violated by a run that simply stops at 0. Reachability alone does not prove liveness."

var count : 0..3 = 0

process Counter {
  action tick when count < 3 { count := count + 1 }
}

terminal count = 3

invariant InRange: count >= 0 and count <= 3
liveness ReachesThree: eventually count = 3
